  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Charlie's Birthday Breakdown**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 12 archived performances [6]\n- **Dreadful Wind & Rain**: back after 37 archived shows (556 days); rare: 11 archived performances [6]\n- **White Dove**: back after 45 archived shows (625 days) [6]\n- **Manzanita**: rare: 9 archived performances [6]\n- **Dire Wolf**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [6]\n- **Oh Babe It Ain't No Lie**: rare: 4 archived performances [6]\n- **Wharf Rat**: rare: 10 archived performances [6]\n- **Riders on the Storm**: back after 235 archived shows (1433 days); rare: 4 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2021-08-01.bsc2** (recommended): source not stated; 25 songs; 140 min; rated 4.33/5 by 3 [1]\n- **billystrings2021-08-01**: source not stated; 25 songs; 138 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Jerry's Birthday [1]\n- Billy Strings and the Bank of NH Pavilion permitted live recording at this Gilford show [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2021-08-01.bsc2**: taped by 603Brett; transferred by 603Brett; source: Source: Busman BSC2 (hypers)> Tascam DR-680 9' FOB just LOC [1]. Also: Recorded with Busman BSC2 microphones (hypers) into a Tascam DR-680, placed nine feet out, front of board, just left of center; Transfer path went from SD card through Audacity and CdWav to FLAC level 8 using TLH [1]\n- **billystrings2021-08-01**: taped by Phil Fernandez; transferred by Phil Fernandez; source: CA14s > CA9100 > Roland R-05 [2]",
